      "spam": false,
      "value": "Yeah the game went from amazing to HORRIFYING on January 22 (3 days ago). All the maps load fast, but players are blue transparent models when you load in, and it becomes unusable on the Oculus Rift because VRChat.exe is actually freezing while downloading player models...\n\nI mean the client FREEZES now. No CPU or GPU usage for small microscopic fractions of a second as each player loads in. Even after you load in, when someone new joins the map, the game ceases to operate for a second while downloading their model.\n\nThe freezing stops the head tracking on the Oculus for ~1/10 second, so you end up seeing a seizure-inducing nightmare where the game is 90fps+ and running real smooth, but randomly jitters all over the place because the client freezes when downloading player model data (or map data, to a lesser extent).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
